~ start
if not GameState.talked_to_glep:
	Glep: Hi I am [wave]glep[/wave] .
	Glep: Use arrow keys to move
	Glep: Head down to the dock [wait=1]press e and start fishing
	Glep: A bar will apear left mouse click when the bar is in the green to catch the taiyaki
	Glep: There is a taiyaki caught number in the top left corner
	Glep: Does this all make sense
	- I undestand
		Glep: Good come back to my shack once u have gotten  10 taiyaki
	- Im confuesed where am I?
		Glep: Dont worry[wait=1] I was to [wait=1] You will figure it out [wait=2] Just come back when you have gotten 10 taiyaki 
	$> GameState.talked_to_glep = true 
else:
	Glep: Hi you got that taiyaki
	- yes
		if GameState.taiyaki_caught>=10:
			Glep: wow congrats that is all that god has coded for now
			Glep: Updates to come!
		else:
			Glep: Glep is very upset u lied
			Glep: go fish and get the remaining taiyaki
	- no
		if GameState.taiyaki_caught>=10:
			Glep: oh it looks like u have why did u tell me no?
			Glep: Anyways congrats that is all that god has coded for now
			Glep: Updates to come!
		else:
			Glep: Go fish then!!! [wait=1] What are you waiting for?
	

=> END